{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Starium</strong> is an open-world <strong>action RPG / bullet-hell</strong> hybrid set in the collapsing galaxy of <strong>Talara</strong>, where dying stars fuel a brutal war for survival. Build your hero, forge powerful gear, and carve your destiny through branching stories and multiple endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you become a savior, an outlaw, or something far more dangerous?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327700/extras/09ab8897d8f47f3af07987899bbbe076.avif?t=1772024118\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327700/extras_big/09ab8897d8f47f3af07987899bbbe076.avif?t=1772024118 width=800 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless Bullet Hell Combat</strong>: Dodge, weave, and unleash chaos in fast-paced top-down battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>25+ Epic Boss Fights</strong>: Face off against towering demons, twisted monstrosities, ruthless war generals, and sinister corporate agents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60+ Legendary Armor Pieces</strong>: Rain exploding bullets, bend space with black holes, channel raw magic, or fuse it all into one unstoppable build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Character Creation</strong>: Choose your race, criminality or military service, personality traits, and even wild flaws like vampirism.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Stories &amp; Multiple Endings</strong>: Forge your own path with branching dialogue, choice-filled moments and multiple endings.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Living, Dying World</strong>: Explore Rhalara, a hostile frontier crawling with mutant rats, outlaws, and horrifying aliens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge for Every Player</strong>: From a chill story mode to the merciless gauntlet of Master difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arsenal of 35+ Weapons &amp; Spells</strong>: Guns, staffs, and sorcery.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Unique Skill Trees</strong>: Master Cosmic Sorcery, embrace the stealth and steel of the Shadow Warrior, or bend minds with the Word Weaver.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327700/extras/c9b9c2fba112132a237e878561f6f702.poster.avif?t=1772024118\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327700/extras/c9b9c2fba112132a237e878561f6f702.webm?t=1772024118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327700/extras/c9b9c2fba112132a237e878561f6f702.mp4?t=1772024118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327700/extras/37664c19c65592f5275dbdb652a1268b.avif?t=1772024118\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327700/extras_big/37664c19c65592f5275dbdb652a1268b.avif?t=1772024118 width=800 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The galaxy of <strong>Talara</strong> is a realm of limitless possibilities and dire consequences. At its core lies \u2018<strong>Starium</strong>\u2019, a rare fuel extracted from dying stars, fueling both progress and destruction. As you arrive in this volatile frontier, you\u2019ll uncover peril, opportunity, and moral dilemmas at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Will you rise as a savior, seize power as an opportunist, or carve out your own destiny among the stars?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327700/extras/d7620a0d1afe12070b4fc042ab33ea4c.poster.avif?t=1772024118\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327700/extras/d7620a0d1afe12070b4fc042ab33ea4c.webm?t=1772024118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327700/extras/d7620a0d1afe12070b4fc042ab33ea4c.mp4?t=1772024118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327700/extras/74f5684071f8e739a9b4523a778a1e4e.avif?t=1772024118\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327700/extras_big/74f5684071f8e739a9b4523a778a1e4e.avif?t=1772024118 width=800 height=167 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your approach:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become an honorable hero, a stealthy infiltrator, a peaceful negotiator, or a relentless force of destruction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your story through your choices, reputation, and relationships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave your mark on a galaxy torn between hope and ruin.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327700/extras/93f10ae9d56d540a2c4317f38ef5fded.poster.avif?t=1772024118\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327700/extras/93f10a